    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Dr Tashmin Khamis, the Director of the Network of Quality Assurance and Improvement (QAI_net) and Network Teaching and Learning (TL-net) paid a courtesy call on the new Executive Secretary of Inter-University Council of East Africa (IUCEA), Professor Alexandre Lyambabaje.  Prof Lyambabaje has assumed office to lead the Inter-University Council for East Africa (IUCEA) for the next five years following the end of tenure of Prof. Mayunga Nkunya who led the institution since 2010. IUCEA is a legally mandated body that was created by the East African Community (EAC) to:",
